<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces are confronting renewed violence in the southern provinces, with surveillance cameras torched and tyres set alight in Narathiwat and attacks continuing in three provinces. The Thai foreign minister met Myanmar leader Min Aung Hlaing to discuss border security and arsenic-tainted rivers, while Thailand is demanding action on mining waste flowing from Myanmar. Cambodia’s prime minister Hun Manet used the Francophonie summit to accuse Thailand of occupying Cambodian land and called for resumption of border demarcation, prompting Thai army accusations that Cambodia is politicising a border temple display. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPYko2TXRuRkZsdy04WmdzaW95MzJCTjdfVjFiS1llRGEzOHJCbWpXS1ZTcFJNeS1RVlNRN1RDd2F6OVdYeTVBaHNITWFJX3ZPRkdwVDhiV0tsOFk1eEk3ZkZUSFVnTTN5Tm9pa05qQWZuaUFuYWhGbW5PekxvRGxkUTJfT0VzTmU2Q2VZLVJtd2E3cXVrdml2WjdISkJtNWV5eXZDS2pQc1c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Daily Dazzling Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/week-asia/economics/article/3374464/malaysian-plan-let-refugees-work-spurs-advocates-call-safeguards&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNUUdxNHdVajZ1X24zbHFVeXpnOGYyRUtCVGJWUnpJVlhkTU4yTkRyZkVaejNiQ0F4M2JnVmUtSDF6eFRad0pPSnp2eUktTzE1NHBHZmY5MnV3SUVPd3dIa3VlcDhPTkZ6U3NpYXJ0MHhuSFFjTXlmTVBodXpHam82ZnZYNjRrZnJtaDd2REFRQ2swQUJzSkowUFNsX2NxOW05QzhBSg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Taarifa Rwanda&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPUnlNQmF2UnVxemFIVm5ISlFwYjRJZTVJRkN3bEdvNkJ4c1ExZDBoQWRRVXZkY0lTQjBBUXFsdU52ZHpsY3R0bXpfY3V2TmpidnNyQXh0eXVMYjZRUnRjSENqSlNndzdvYVRMdkRrUWh6RzV3V2dvNHJ2YW9sbXBxX0dxWWNtQnJObFkxYUVZbTBpTTRRQjFFQkh3TVlrN1lxSDRoSlpSRHBzcTNPZEV3WDNOSUtzQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bang